// # 2026-09-10 — MCP, LSP, Blackbox, install.sh Usability Audit
//
// Logline: 28 issues found across MCP, LSP, blackbox, install.sh, and
//          harness_wire.oo. Root cause: jail env OODA_FS_WRITEDIR is missing
//          from every blackbox env in 11 of 11 wire_* functions, plus grok
//          references nonexistent ooda-mcp-grok and ooda-lsp-grok shims,
//          plus a bash quoting bug in wire_mistral_vibe drops WRITEDIR.
//
// Setup: Read alongside the 5 service docs in their own repos:
//          - mcp/docs/MCP_SETUP.oot
//          - lsp/docs/LSP_SETUP.oot
//          - blackbox/docs/blackbox.oot
//          - install/ANCHOR.oo
//          - install/harness_wire.oo
//        Each numbered item has a Fix column. The first column is a stable
//        ID for the issue. Run install/repair_harness_wiring.sh to patch
//        existing broken configs without a full reinstall.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Smoking-gun evidence (what fails, what works, what is missing).
//   2. install.sh bugs by function.
//   3. harness_wire.oo gaps.
//   4. Doc / contract gaps in mcp, lsp, blackbox.
//   5. Fixes shipped in this commit and the 5 follow-on commits.
//
// 1. EVIDENCE (this is what was on disk on 2026-09-10 07:05 UTC+10) -------
//
// $ agy mcp list
// NAME      TYPE   STATUS   COMMAND/URL
// blackbox  stdio  enabled  /usr/bin/stdbuf -o0 -e0 .../blackbox mcp --stdio
// openooda  stdio  enabled  .../ooda-mcp --stdio
//
// $ cat ~/.grok/config.toml (relevant slice)
//   [mcp_servers.openooda.env]
//   OODA_CODEX = "/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/openOODA/NORTHSTAR.oot"
//   OODA_FS_READDIR = "/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA"
//   # OODA_FS_WRITEDIR is MISSING.
//
// $ cat ~/.grok/lsp.json (relevant slice)
//   "command": "/home/jeryd/.openooda/bin/ooda-lsp-grok",   # DOES NOT EXIST
//   "env": { "OODA_COMPILER": "...", "OODA_FS_READDIR": "..." }
//   # OODA_FS_WRITEDIR is MISSING.
//
// $ ls ~/.openooda/bin/
//   bb-call  blackbox  liboodar.a  ooda  oodac  oodac_bin.core  ooda-lsp
//   ooda-lsp-call  ooda-mcp  ooda-mcp-call  opm
//   # ooda-mcp-grok and ooda-lsp-grok are referenced by install.sh but never installed.
//
// $ cat ~/.vibe/config.toml (relevant slice)
//   [[mcp_servers]]  name = "blackbox"
//   [mcp_servers.env]                      # TOML pitfall: this is the SAME
//   OODA_FS_READDIR = "/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA"   # table as the
//   OODA_COMPILER = "/home/jeryd/.openooda/bin/oodac"   # openooda entry;
//   OODAC_BIN = "/home/jeryd/.openooda/bin/oodac"       # openooda has
//   # OODA_FS_WRITEDIR is MISSING.                        # WRITEDIR, but
//                                                       # the merged env
//                                                       # does not expose
//                                                       # it per-server.
//
// $ cat ~/.config/muse/settings.json
//   openooda: READDIR+WRITEDIR+COMPILER+CODEX  OK
//   blackbox: READDIR+COMPILER (no OODAC_BIN, no OODA_FS_WRITEDIR)  FAIL
//
// $ cat ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json
//   openooda: READDIR=HOME, WRITEDIR=HOME, no OODA_COMPILER  (works by luck)
//   blackbox: READDIR+COMPILER+OODAC_BIN (no OODA_FS_WRITEDIR)  FAIL
//
// Probes (each returns the noted output):
//
//  $ echo init | env -u OODA_FS_WRITEDIR ooda-mcp --stdio
//  ERR landlock OODA_FS_READDIR and OODA_FS_WRITEDIR required (or OODA_NO_JAIL=1)
//
//  $ echo init | env -u OODA_FS_READDIR ooda-mcp --stdio
//  ERR landlock OODA_FS_READDIR and OODA_FS_WRITEDIR required (or OODA_NO_JAIL=1)
//
//  $ echo init | ooda-mcp --stdio   (all envs set)
//  Content-Length: 215  + valid initialize response, serverInfo.codexVersion=07bed6c5
//
// Conclusion: the MCP server is correct. The wiring is what is wrong.
//
// 2. install.sh BUGS BY FUNCTION --------------------------------------------
//
//  ID  | Function             | Line | Issue                              | Fix
// -----+----------------------+------+------------------------------------+-------
// I-01 | wire_agy             | 548  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-02 | wire_opencode        | 585  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-03 | wire_gemini          | 617  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-04 | wire_grok            | 652  | command is ooda-mcp-grok, missing  | use ooda-mcp --stdio
// I-05 | wire_grok            | 658  | openooda env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-06 | wire_grok            | 674  | lsp.json env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-07 | wire_grok            | 674  | lsp.json command is ooda-lsp-grok  | use ooda-lsp
// I-08 | wire_muse            | 707  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-09 | wire_muse            | 690  | skips when ~/.config/muse missing  | create dir + write
// I-10 | wire_claude_code     | 741  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-11 | wire_claude_desktop  | 781  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-12 | wire_cursor          | 806  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-13 | wire_windsurf        | 834  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-14 | wire_codex           | 882  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-15 | wire_cline           | 909  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-16 | wire_continue        | 934  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-17 | wire_zed             | 958  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-18 | wire_vscode          | 985  | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-19 | wire_goose           | 1011 | blackbox env has no WRITEDIR       | add
// I-20 | wire_mistral_vibe    | 1026 | bash quoting drops --env before    | add --env
//      |                      |      | OODA_FS_WRITEDIR                    |
// I-21 | wire_* (all)         | 511  | muse/grok require prior config dir | always create + write
// I-22 | (none)               |  -   | mcode (minimax-code) has no wire   | add wire_mcode
//
// 3. harness_wire.oo GAPS ---------------------------------------------------
//
//  ID  | Function           | Line | Issue                              | Fix
// -----+--------------------+------+------------------------------------+-------
// H-01 | wire_cli_agy       | 152  | stub: prints wired, does nothing   | make no-op; bash handles
// H-02 | wire_cli_vibe      | 160  | stub                               | make no-op
// H-03 | wire_cli_codex     | 168  | stub                               | make no-op
// H-04 | wire_cli_claude    | 176  | stub                               | make no-op
// H-05 | (none)             |  -   | muse, grok, mcode, cline, vscode,  | not in .oo, bash does
//      |                    |      | goose, antigravity-cli missing     | the real work
//
// The four H-01..H-04 stubs lie. They return true after printing "wired",
// but do not run any mcp-add command. install.sh trusts the return value
// and skips the bash fallback. This is the worst kind of bug: success
// printed, work undone.
//
// 4. DOC / CONTRACT GAPS ----------------------------------------------------
//
//  ID  | Doc                  | Issue                              | Fix
// -----+----------------------+------------------------------------+-------
// D-01 | mcp/docs/MCP_SETUP   | jail env invariant buried          | lead with the rule
// D-02 | lsp/docs/LSP_SETUP   | same                               | same
// D-03 | blackbox/docs/blackbox | same                              | same
// D-04 | install/ANCHOR       | 15 harnesses advertised; 4 stubs   | honest about .oo vs bash
//
// 5. FIXES SHIPPED IN THIS COMMIT -------------------------------------------
//
//  install/install.sh:
//    - 11 wire_* functions patched to set OODA_FS_WRITEDIR in blackbox env
//    - wire_grok uses ooda-mcp --stdio (no -grok shim), includes WRITEDIR
//    - wire_grok writes lsp.json with ooda-lsp (no -grok), includes WRITEDIR
//    - wire_mistral_vibe adds the missing --env flag before WRITEDIR
//    - wire_muse / wire_grok always create the config dir (no chicken-and-egg)
//    - new wire_mcode for ~/.minimax/config.yaml
//    - post_flight now verifies WRITEDIR is present, not just openooda key
//
//  install/harness_wire.oo:
//    - wire_cli_agy, wire_cli_vibe, wire_cli_codex, wire_cli_claude
//      now return false and print "defer to bash", so install.sh
//      cannot be tricked into skipping the bash fallback
//
//  install/repair_harness_wiring.sh (new):
//    - one-shot fixer for already-installed broken configs
//    - patches ~/.config/muse, ~/.grok, ~/.vibe, ~/.gemini in place
//    - backup-rename to *.bak.repair-$TS so uninstall stays correct
//
//  mcp/docs/MCP_SETUP.oot, lsp/docs/LSP_SETUP.oot, blackbox/docs/blackbox.oot:
//    - lead with the jail env invariant; require both OODA_FS_READDIR and
//      OODA_FS_WRITEDIR; call out OODA_NO_JAIL=1 escape hatch
//
//  install/VERSION bumped 0.1.30 -> 0.1.31.
//
//  VERIFICATION (after the patch, on the same machine):
//    $ /home/jeryd/.openooda/bin/ooda-mcp --stdio < init   # still works
//    $ agy mcp list                                        # both wired
//    $ bash install/repair_harness_wiring.sh --probe       # all green
